{"html": "<div  id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"tema-container\">\n\t\t\n\n\t<div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area primary\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\">\n\t\t\t\t<article\nclass=\"page type-page status-publish tema-article-single\" id=\"entrada-45\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\" itemscope=\"itemscope\">\n\t\n\t\t\t\t<header class=\"entry-header tema-no-thumbnail tema-no-title tema-header-without-markup\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</header> \n\t\t\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\"\n\titemprop=\"text\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\t<div data-bl-type=\"s-page\" data-bl-id=\"45\" class=\"bl bl-45\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-element bl-element-1af52d14 bl-section-content-middle bl-section-boxed\" data-id=\"1af52d14\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-container bl-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element\" data-id=\"2dd39b03\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-5024f918 bl-widget bl-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5024f918\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"bl-heading-title bl-size-default\">¿Qué es Socios.Pro?</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-widget bl-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"28ced5fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p1\">Socios.Pro <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">es un <a href=\"/\" title=\"software de gestión para asociaciones y fundaciones\">software de gestión para asociaciones y fundaciones</a> que integra <strong>gestión de asociados</strong>, <strong>facturación</strong> y <strong>contabilidad</strong> para entidades sin ánimo de lucro</span>. Pertenecemos a Gespymes, por lo que trabajamos desde 2006 en mejorar a empresas, pymes y asociaciones en todo el mundo. Hemos diseñado, desarrollado e implantado programas de gestión online teniendo en cuenta las necesidades y preferencias de nuestros clientes.</p>\n\n<p class=\"p1\">De esta forma, contamos con un software de gestión adaptado a lo que específicamente necesita una asociación sin ánimo de lucro requiere.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element\" data-id=\"ed5d43d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-3827acb3 bl-invisible bl-widget bl-widget-image\" data-id=\"3827acb3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_mouse&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_tilt_effect&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_tilt_speed&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"/images/2025/04/que_es.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full img-71\" alt=\"Que es socios.pro\" srcset=\"/images/2025/04/que_es.webp 1200w, /images/2025/04/que_es-300x300.webp 300w, /images/2025/04/que_es-1024x1024.webp 1024w, /images/2025/04/que_es-150x150.webp 150w, /images/2025/04/que_es-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-element bl-element-343e93c